flowchart LR
    T["A leader's turn starts"] --> I["The leader inspects"]
    I --> S["It picks an asset and starts<br/>a session for its own outcome"]
    S --> Q{"Did every<br/>follower sign?"}
    Q -->|"yes"| R["It responds with<br/>the signed answer"]
    Q -->|"no"| M{"Fewer than three attempts,<br/>no answer yet,<br/>and the same outcome?"}
    M -->|"yes: retry with<br/>another asset"| S
    M -->|"no"| X["It stops. The next leader<br/>takes over on its turn."]
